OL,3,GNEWSATeen 'collapsed' after sleeping in
OL,4,Amouldy bedroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sisters have been unable to sleep
OL,7,Fin their bedroom for months because of
OL,8,Fblack mould, their mum says.
OL,10,FOpen University student Leah Morgan
OL,11,Fclaimed the problem was so bad her
OL,12,F14-year-old daughter had collapsed and
OL,13,Fwas now sleeping on a mattress in the
OL,14,Flounge.
OL,16,FHer five-year-old daughter was still
OL,17,Fsleeping in her bedroom, she added,
OL,18,Fsaying she had been complaining about
OL,19,Fthe Bulwark, Chepstow, home to
OL,20,FMonmouthshire Housing Association for
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
