OL,3,GNEWSATeen 'collapsed' after sleeping in
OL,4,Amouldy bedroom
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My eldest just walked out of the
OL,7,Fbedroom one day and said her chest hurt
OL,8,Fand she wasn't feeling very well. She
OL,9,Fthen collapsed on the kitchen floor,"
OL,10,Fthe mum-of-two said.
